YOUR OFFER DETAILS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  •  Program start: Monday, November 2, 2026
  •  Schedule: Monday to Wednesday in-person (10 AM to 4 PM)
  •  Thursday and Friday remote
  •  Duration: 10 weeks (through January 25, 2027, with breaks for Thanksgiving and the winter holidays)
  •  Cost to you: $0

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
WHAT YOU'LL GET
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  •  Free professional training in HubSpot CRM, Revenue Operations, and AI tools

  •  Industry certifications (HubSpot, Google, Salesforce)

  •  Career coaching, employer connections, and a Demo Day presentation

  •  Wraparound support:  We're committed to helping you succeed. Program staff will work with you to assess your needs and connect you with appropriate support services throughout your training.

